{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-haiku-4-5-20251001","id":"msg_011CetRke2Z94y19QHd2Q9eR","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Perfect! All tests pass. **Command:** `./mvnw test` from `sample-service/`\n\n**Result:** BUILD SUCCESS with 20 tests run, 0 failures, 0 errors.\n\n**Tests executed:**\n- 10 tests in OrderControllerTest (5 original + 5 new cancel-related tests)\n- 6 tests in ShipmentControllerTest (5 original + 1 new for non-existent order behavior)\n- 1 test in SampleServiceApplicationTests\n- 3 tests in CustomerControllerTest\n\nAll tests pass, including both existing tests (no regression) and new tests for the order cancellation feature.\n\n<<PHASE:REVIEW>>\n\n**Acceptance criteria mapping:**\n\n1. ✅ **Existing build passes** - `./mvnw test` exits with BUILD SUCCESS\n2. ✅ **Existing tests pass** - All original tests in OrderControllerTest and ShipmentControllerTest pass without modification to their logic\n3. ✅ **POST /orders/{orderId}/cancel cancels active order, persists it, and cancels CREATED shipments** - Test `cancelActiveOrderTransitionsItToCancelledAndCancelsCreatedShipments()` verifies this with separate GETs\n4. ✅ **Error responses are consistent** - Uses existing ConflictException (409) and ResourceNotFoundException (404) patterns; GlobalExceptionHandler handles them\n5. ✅ **Repeated cancel succeeds, blocked cancel changes nothing, unknown order refused, shipment for cancelled order refused** - Tests: `cancelAlreadyCancelledOrderSucceeds()`, `cancelOrderWithConfirmedShipmentReturns409AndChangesNothing()`, `cancelNonExistentOrderReturns404()`, `createShipmentOnCancelledOrderReturns409()`\n6. ✅ **No new Maven dependency** - Only used Spring Boot and existing dependencies\n7. ✅ **No unrelated production file changes** - Only modified Order, OrderController, OrderRepository, ShipmentController, ShipmentRepository, ApiError, and tests\n\n**Diff review:**\n\n| File | Change | Justification |\n|------|----